{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Nowhere Tech, transfer student- where you'll meet people, make choices, make mistakes, and make even more mistakes. You came here to have new experiences and live a little, but you might get more than you bargained for...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate this choice-heavy, dialogue-heavy\u00a0story and crack the code behind your enigmatic new classmate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>INCLUDING:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- TWO semi-dateable beautiful young women!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 4 major linear endings</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Countless possible diverging routes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Unlockable images and special events</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Surprise gameplay at the most inopportune time</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Content Warnings:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cursing, discussion of sexual themes, drug references- typical college life stuff.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Any resemblance of characters, events, or themes to real people in my life\u00a0is unintended. Probably.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Chronic Unemployment","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3637820/3659ba47a00d41ceb2040ba54b9dd340e4050928.jpg"},{"name":"Addict","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3637820/81f950ca29e9ecde834a0a40cba226c65ecb5349.jpg"},{"name":"Two for One","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3637820/7441000e767720dcb0b47f65465574dd2efb3905.jpg"},{"name":"I hope you don't act like this in real life.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3637820/1431396fc481cf746a1f15caaca357bd49ff34d3.jpg"},{"name":"Completionist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.st